WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.594
I don't remember the first toy Dad made. But I
remember this day.

2
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:13.611
He said nobody wanted them anymore. His hands
hadn't forgotten. So I filmed them.

3
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.601
One small video on iAdMe. Of something he'd
spent a lifetime learning.

4
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:24.508
A man nearby recognised the wooden bird his
own father had once made for him.

5
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.474
His message was simple. Could your dad make
one for my daughter?

6
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.706
Dad read it twice. Then he took out his tools.

7
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:43.886
When the man came to collect it, Dad wrapped
it like something precious.

8
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:53.423
It was. Someone still wanted what he had to
give. I think he needed to know that.

9
00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:59.368
iAdMe. Share what you love. Find your people.
